+Among the 12 distinct labels previously discussed, seven now resolve from exact NLM XML term associations: Physical Therapy Techniques, Patient Education, Electrical Stimulation, Bladder, Neurogenic, Cell Phones, Occupational Therapist and Physical Therapist. No case-specific mappings were added. Anal Canal and Neoplasms, Card iac Output, Telepsychiatry, Respiration Artificial and Speech Therapist remain unresolved under this descriptor snapshot.
